      "label": "Screen specifications\n\nLogo: Kids Central (will create logo later)\n\nArea: Middlesbrough only to begin with. Future will be a search input. User can type and at the same time show a dropdown with towns and cities in alphabetical order A-Z\n\nRadius (in miles): Dropdown in increments of 5, last option is 60\n\nAge range: Dropdown, options 0-2\n2-4\n4-7\n7-11",
