      "type": "text",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "label": "Screen specifications\n\nFilters (not to include descriptions, just for key terms)\n\nActive & physical\nSoft play, swimming/splash sessions, sports taster sessions, trampolining, climbing, martial arts, dance, gymnastics.\n\nCreative & making\nArts & crafts, pottery/ceramics, cooking/baking, Lego/building, science & STEM workshops.\n\nPerformance & shows\nTheatre & pantomime, cinema/film screenings, live music & singalongs, puppet shows, magic shows.\n\nLearning & discovery\nMuseums & galleries (kids programmes), library sessions & story time, nature/wildlife, farm visits, workshops & talks.\n\nOutdoor & seasonal\nParks & playgrounds events, forest school/outdoor play, festivals & fairs, seasonal events (Halloween, Christmas grottos, Easter egg hunts, summer holiday programmes).\n\nPlay & social\nBaby & toddler groups, sensory play, play cafés, meetups & playdates, party venues.\n\nDays out / attractions\nZoos & aquariums, adventure parks, indoor play centres, trampoline parks (overlaps with active — see note below)",
      "autoSize": false,
      "flipX": false,
      "rotation": 0,
      "flipY": false
