      "fontWeight": 400,
      "label": "Screen specifications\n\nAddress formatting:\n\nHouse number/name\nAddress line 1\nAddress line 2\nPost code\n\nDate formatting: DD/MM/YY\nTime formatting: 12h\n\nPrice (if available)\n\nContact details (if advertised): Contact name and method (phone or email)\n\nMore information: Button to external site\n\nIf signed in then the user would see an edit option.",
