      "fontWeight": 400,
      "x": 1800,
      "fontFamily": "Barlow",
      "flipX": false,
      "label": "Screen specifications\n\nDate of event: Calendar picker\n\nFrom: Time picker\n\nTo: Time picker\n\nOccurance:\n\nWeekly option would reveal day options, Monday to Sunday where the user can multi-select or deselect the relevant day/days.\n\nBi-Weekly similar to weekly but shows 2 weeks.\n\nCustom:\n\nTwo dropdowns side by side. First dropdown user selects every X where X is a number, next dropdown options include Day, Week, Month. Week would reveal the same day options as the Weekly option. Monthly option would show days 1 to 28, where the user could multi-select or deselect.\n\nIf editing an event then there is a delete option",
